00:11:43.020 --> 00:11:44.280
Like they would mix and match them.
就像他们会把它们混搭一样。

248
00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:47.360
They weren't always the ones that you thought they were going to be paired with.
它们并不总是和你原本以为会搭配的那一集在一起。

249
00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:48.620
Yeah, exactly.
对，完全是这样。

250
00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:52.220
Because they were movable because they were their own little story.
因为它们是可以移动的，它们本身就是一个个独立的小故事。

251
00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:59.880
But also, sometimes they just got rid of them completely because they needed the time to
但同时，有时他们会直接把它们删掉，因为他们需要时间来

252
00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:01.400
tell the story of the episode.
讲好单集的故事。

253
00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:01.940
Right.
没错。

254
00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:05.460
And if it is self-contained and modular like that, it's easier to take out.
而且如果是这种独立且模块化的情节，就更容易删减。

255
00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.760
Whereas if you start the story, you're kind of stuck with it.
而如果你一开始就铺陈故事，基本上就摆脱不掉了。

256
00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:07.980
Right.
没错。

